{
  "sourceLanguage": "de",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "Showcase Immich": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Showcase Immich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verbinde die App mit deinem Immich-Showcase-Server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect the app to your Immich Showcase server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wichtig vorab": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Important first"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese App verbindet sich **nicht direkt mit Immich**. Sie braucht einen eigenen **Immich-Showcase-Server**, den du selbst betreibst (neben deinem Immich, z. B. im Heimnetz).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app does **not connect to Immich directly**. It needs your own **Immich Showcase server**, which you run yourself (next to your Immich, e.g. at home)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne diesen Server kann die App nichts anzeigen. Anleitung und Installation findest du auf GitHub.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without this server the app can't show anything. You'll find the guide and installation on GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immich Showcase auf GitHub": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Immich Showcase on GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adresse des Servers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Server address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verbinden": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo ausprobieren (ohne Server)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try the demo (no server needed)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR-Code scannen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So kommst du an den QR-Code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to get the QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Öffne die Showcase-Seite deines Servers am Computer oder in einem Browser, zum Beispiel unter der Adresse, die du auch hier eintippen würdest (192.168.1.20:8090).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open your server's Showcase page on a computer or in a browser, for example at the address you would type in here (192.168.1.20:8090)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tippe oben rechts auf das **Konto-Symbol** (Person) und wähle **Einstellungen**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the **account icon** (person) at the top right and choose **Settings**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ganz unten steht **„iPhone-App verbinden“** mit einem QR-Code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the very bottom you'll find **“Connect iPhone app”** with a QR code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tippe hier auf **QR-Code scannen** und halte die Kamera auf diesen Code. Fertig.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap **Scan QR code** here and point the camera at that code. Done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Den Code findest du auch am Ende der Einrichtung des Servers (Seite „/setup/“). Er enthält nur die Adresse, keine PIN und kein Passwort.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll also find the code at the end of the server setup (page “/setup/”). It only contains the address, no PIN and no password."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dieser QR-Code enthält keine Server-Adresse.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This QR code doesn't contain a server address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suche Server im WLAN …": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking for servers on Wi-Fi …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im WLAN wurde kein Server gefunden. Tippe die Adresse ein oder scanne den QR-Code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No server found on Wi-Fi. Type the address or scan the QR code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erneut suchen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Server wurde gefunden": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your server was found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gefunden im WLAN": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Found on Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server in einem anderen Netz suchen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look for a server in another network"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steht der Server in einem anderen Netz (z. B. einem eigenen Server-Netz), gib dessen Anfang an, zum Beispiel 192.168.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the server is in another network (e.g. its own server network), enter the beginning of its address, for example 192.168.2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suchen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitte ein privates Netz angeben, z. B. 192.168.2 oder 172.16.5.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please enter a private network, e.g. 192.168.2 or 172.16.5."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zuletzt verbunden": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitte eine Adresse wie 192.168.1.20:8090 eingeben.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please enter an address like 192.168.1.20:8090."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo-Modus: Beispielfotos, es wird nichts gesendet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo mode: sample photos, nothing is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo beenden und eigenen Server verbinden": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End demo and connect your own server"
